[38;5;231m⏺[39m Good — that's the plan.

  Now the task layer. Since notifications will consume whatever changes we emit, the fields we pick here determine what
  there is to notify [3mabout[0m: a due date makes "due soon" possible, an assignee makes "assigned to you" possible, and a
  task with neither can only ever notify "this changed."

  I want to start from the smallest thing that's genuinely useful to you rather than a generic todo app.
